##  Creational Design Patterns (Assignment 10)

| Pattern | Use Case in Rural Hospital System | Reason |
|--------|----------------------------------|--------|
| Simple Factory | Appointment creation | Centralizes appointment logic |
| Factory Method | Notification system | Supports different notification types |
| Abstract Factory | UI components | Supports multiple platforms (mobile/desktop) |
| Builder | Medical records | Handles complex object creation |
| Prototype | Patient records | Allows cloning without reloading data |
| Singleton | Database connection | Ensures single shared connection |
